!**/.env.example
# apps/store's bun:test-only override — blanks ZEROENTROPY_API_KEY so
# `bun test` never inherits the real key from apps/store/.env (Global
# Rule 6, no real paid provider calls from a test loop). No secret in it.
!apps/store/.env.test
